 "name_en": "Lean Customer Returns (BDD)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Lean Customer Returns (BDD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8fdf77c6e3fe40f188d84b361f53e698\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8fdf77c6e3fe40f188d84b361f53e698__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process starts with the creation of a lean returns order, optionally with reference to the original sales order or invoice. A returns delivery is created with reference to the lean returns order. When the products are shipped back, a goods receipt is posted to unrestricted-use stock. To compensate the customer, a credit memo is created manually or by the billing run.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8fdf77c6e3fe40f188d84b361f53e698__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create returns order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create returns delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit memo</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8fdf77c6e3fe40f188d84b361f53e698__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Use simplified processing of customers returns</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>精简客户退货 (BDD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8fdf77c6e3fe40f188d84b361f53e698\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8fdf77c6e3fe40f188d84b361f53e698__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">该流程从创建精简退货订单开始，可以选择参考原始销售订单或发票。参考精简退货订单创建退货交货。退回产品后，会将收货过账到非限制使用库存。要补偿客户，请手动或通过开票运行创建贷项凭证。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8fdf77c6e3fe40f188d84b361f53e698__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建退货订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建退货交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建贷项凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8fdf77c6e3fe40f188d84b361f53e698__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用简化的客户退货处理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
